/*
PoolType
    │
    ▼
PoolBuilder::setPool()        ← Builds the character pool
    │
    ▼
PoolCompatibility::validate()  ← Checks pool against PasswordPolicy
    │                              Removes repeated characters
    ▼
PoolAnalyzer::poolChecker()   ← Categorizes into Lower/Upper/Digits/Symbols indices
    │
    ▼
Generator::generateByPolicy() ← Uses indices + engine to pick characters
    │                              Future: Botan/Crypto++ RNG
    ▼
Password output               ← String, stream, file, wordlist
    │
    ▼
Brute-force estimator         ← Estimates cracking time/power
*/




